<title>USA: CCC buys 5,000 tonnes U.S. sorghum for Kenya.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 5,000 tonnes U.S. sorghum for Kenya.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it had purchased 5,000 tonnes of U.S. sorghum from Archer Daniels Midland Co for export to Kenya, May 5-31 delivery.</p>
<p>The sorghum was priced at $124.33 per tonne, FOB Reserve.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
